avogadro.configuration.worldHud.mode=Key Mode
avogadro.configuration.worldHud.mode.tooltip=HOLD displays the molecule while the key is held. TOGGLE switches it on or off with each press.

avogadro.configuration.worldHud.provider=HUD Provider
avogadro.configuration.worldHud.provider.tooltip=AUTO selects an available HUD. PROBE uses The One Probe. WAILA uses HWYLA or Waila.

